## CEMDS Button System Rule

❌ Never use `<button>` directly in application code.
✅ Always use `<CmButton>`.

The only place where native `<button>` should exist is inside `CmButton.vue` itself. This ensures that every future button automatically inherits your CEMDS theme, light mode, dark mode, spacing, focus rings, accessibility, and branding without requiring manual styling.
